// hr_c14: Hive City remaster, the red neon stairs and the HEAVEN SENT sign between the pillars (camera c14), lower city level.
// No ReflectScale anywhere (the owner: floors were too reflective; the perforated treads kept at a low smoothness).
// smoothness scales the _gloss map (R smoothness, G metalness); "default" is the concrete-sound entry of materials.def.
// pxmat (2026-11-24): + ReliefScale (parallax, textures/<name>_hmap), ReflectScale on metal/glass/lamps (floors stay dry), detailmap.
"hr_c14_wall"
{
	"material" "default"
	"smoothness" "0.25"
	"ReliefScale" "0.07"
	"detailmap" "textures/detail/pxd_concrete"
	"detailScale" "8"
}
